  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary Contribution to the UNOCHA Regional West and Central Africa Humanitarian Fund for 2025. The RHFWCA supports the timely allocations and disbursement of donor resources to the most critical humanitarian needs defined in the HNRP. Partners implement a variety of multi-sectoral interventions on the basis of need and targeting the most vulnerable. The regional framework focuses on 1) Food Security and Nutrition 2) Displacement and 3) Climate Change.</narrative>
  </description>
